"The task “%(task)s” (project %(project)s) was due on %(date)s and is still "
"not done."
msgstr ""
"La tâche « %(task)s » (projet %(project)s) devait être terminée le %(date)s "
"et ne l'est toujours pas."

#: .\apps\communication\emails.py
#, python-format
